WEBVTT

00:02:59.858 --> 00:03:01.347
they can become impossibly small.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:04.948
We can make folds that we otherwise could not make.

00:03:04.948 --> 00:03:06.826
Surfaces can become porous.

00:03:06.826 --> 00:03:09.555
They can stretch. They can tear.

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:14.190
And all of this expounds the scope of forms that we can produce.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.940
But in each case, I didn't design the form.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:21.541
I designed the process that generated the form.

00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:26.029
In general, if we make a small change to the folding ratio,

00:03:26.029 --> 00:03:27.624
which is what you're seeing here,

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:31.397
then the form changes correspondingly.